msgstr "Use generative AI assistants for work tasks with structured prompts, protecting sensitive information and verifying results before using them, and propose a usage protocol for a team."

msgid "Usar dependencias con yield para gestionar recursos y consultas parametrizadas para los datos."
msgstr "Use dependencies with yield to manage resources and parameterized queries for the data."

msgid "Usar el histograma para corregir la exposición de una foto sin recortar luces ni sombras."
msgstr "Use the histogram to correct a photo's exposure without clipping highlights or shadows."

msgid "Usar Fetch"
msgstr "Using Fetch"

msgid "Usar fetch para pedir y mostrar datos de una API en una página."
msgstr "Use fetch to request and display data from an API on a page."

